--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -24,6 +24,10 @@ Unreleased
 -   Lazily import ``shutil``. :pr:`3023`
 -   Properly forward exception information to resources registered with
     ``click.core.Context.with_resource()``. :issue:`2447` :pr:`3058`
+-   Fix ``CliRunner`` turning normal end-of-input into an ``EOFError`` for any
+    code that iterates over ``sys.stdin`` directly (e.g. ``for line in file``),
+    which was incorrectly reported as ``Aborted!``. The ``EOFError`` behavior is
+    now scoped to the prompt/confirm input helpers that rely on it.
 
